@startuml
' Two boxes, a created participant, a note block and hide footbox.
hide footbox
box "Client" #LightBlue
  actor Alice
  participant App
end box
box "Server"
  participant API
end box
Alice -> App : log in
App -> API ++ : POST /session
API -> Token ** : issue
note right of API
  token lives
  15 minutes
end note
API --> App -- : 201
loop every minute
  App -> API : refresh
end
||45||
App -> Alice : welcome
@enduml
